WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.602
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.670
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.437
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:07.040
President Biden spoke yesterday

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.609
with Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelensky

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.777
for nearly an hour.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:13.879
Zelensky secured
$500 million in aid

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:17.517
and Biden somehow ended up
with a reverse mortgage.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:21.020
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.956
Intelligence officials
reportedly believe that

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.490
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.127
has only recently learned how
poorly the invasion of Ukraine

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.830
has been going and is angry
with his military advisers.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.131
And you can tell he's upset

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:34.634
because now the table
is even longer.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.036
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:40.039
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy said yesterday

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:42.208
that Republican
Congressman Madison Cawthorn

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.345
admitted that claims
that his fellow lawmakers

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.948
had done cocaine and invited him
to orgies were exaggerated

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.450
and added that Cawthorn
told him he,

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.353
"Doesn't know what cocaine is."

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.387
Guys.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.455
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:59.358
You got to keep
your denials believable.

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:02.061
It's okay if you know
what cocaine is.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.630
I mean, look at this guy.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.130
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:08.201
He knows what cocaine is.

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.735
Maybe he never did any.

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.304
But every guy
who looks like that

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:14.574
hangs out with eight other guys
who look exactly like that,

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.677
and one of them
always has cocaine.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:18.644
"Oh, hold on.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.280
Yeah, no,
it's in my puffy vest."

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.547
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:24.583
McCarthy also added that
Cawthorn has lost his trust,

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:27.820
which is tough because once
you lose Kevin McCarthy's trust,

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.290
you almost immediately
get it back.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.025
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.193
Organizers of Sunday
night's Academy Awards

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:35.595
said in a statement yesterday

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.697
that Will Smith refused to leave
the Oscars

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.065
after slapping Chris Rock
and added that they,

00:01:40.065 --> 00:01:43.202
"recognize we could have handled
the situation differently,"

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.805
like maybe hiring
younger security guards.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.907
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.742
"You got to go!"

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:50.743
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.713
"Got to go.

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:56.149
You got to go.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.450
I don't think he's going to go."

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.751
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.751 --> 00:01:59.652
"Whoa!"

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.287
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.790
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.692
New York Mayor Eric Adams spoke
at an event this week

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:09.028
about the status of
the coronavirus pandemic

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.497
and said, "Everyone
who moved to Florida,

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.465
get your butts back
to New York City."

00:02:13.465 --> 00:02:15.435
Everybody?
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.270
Let's not get carried away.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.272
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.307
Tomorrow is April Fool's Day.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:22.341
April Fool's.

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:23.709
It's actually today,

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:26.746
because my show airs at
a ungodly hour of the morning.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.215
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.952
And finally, according
to a new study,

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.321
men who eat
excessive amounts of meat

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.089
increase the risk
of becoming infertile.

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:39.091
So get ready for that
to be an excuse.

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:41.394
"Baby, we don't need condoms,
I just had ribs."

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:42.795
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.931
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

